---
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms of Service - Ocean Dating App</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Read Ocean's terms of service to understand the rules and guidelines for using our AI-powered dating app." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="header">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="nav">
          <img src="/ocean_wordmark.png" alt="Ocean" class="logo" />
          <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="/blog">Blog</a></li>
            <li><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></li>
            <li><a href="/terms">Terms</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
          <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
          <p>Guidelines for using Ocean responsibly</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="padding: 4rem 0;">
        <div class="container">
          <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.8;">
              Last updated: December 2024
            </p>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Agreement to Terms</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                By using Ocean, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our service.
              </p>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                These terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Ocean regarding your use of our AI-powered dating platform.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Eligibility</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                You must be at least 18 years old to use Ocean. By using our service, you represent that you meet this age requirement and have the legal capacity to enter into these terms.
              </p>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                You are responsible for ensuring that your use of Ocean complies with all applicable laws and regulations in your jurisdiction.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">User Conduct</h2>
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Acceptable Use</h3>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                Ocean is designed to facilitate meaningful connections. You agree to use our platform respectfully and authentically.
              </p>
              
              <h3 style="font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Prohibited Activities</h3>
              <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">• Harassment, bullying, or threatening behavior</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">• Sharing false or misleading information</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">• Spam or commercial solicitation</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">• Attempting to circumvent our AI matching systems</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">• Sharing inappropriate or explicit content</li>
                <li style="margin-bottom: 0.8rem; opacity: 0.9;">• Impersonating others or creating fake profiles</li>
              </ul>
              
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                Violations of these guidelines may result in suspension or permanent removal from the platform.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">AI Matching Service</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                Ocean uses artificial intelligence to analyze user preferences and behavior to suggest compatible matches. While we strive for accuracy, we cannot guarantee specific outcomes or the quality of matches.
              </p>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                Our AI algorithms continuously learn and improve, but match suggestions are based on available data and may not reflect all aspects of compatibility.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Content and Intellectual Property</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                You retain ownership of the content you upload to Ocean, including photos and profile information. However, you grant us a license to use this content to provide our services.
              </p>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                Ocean's technology, including our AI algorithms, user interface, and branding, are protected by intellectual property laws and remain our property.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Limitation of Liability</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                Ocean is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for any damages arising from your use of our service, including but not limited to direct, indirect, or consequential damages.
              </p>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                You acknowledge that online dating carries inherent risks, and you are responsible for your own safety when meeting people through our platform.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Changes to Terms</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                We may update these terms from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes through the app or via email. Your continued use of Ocean after changes constitute acceptance of the new terms.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
              <h2 style="font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Contact Information</h2>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
              </p>
              <p style="line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9; margin-top: 1rem;">
                Email: legal@ocean-app.com<br>
                Subject: Terms of Service Inquiry
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="footer">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-links">
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
          <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
          <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        </div>
        <p>&copy; 2024 Ocean. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>